{"entries":[{"id":"tsk-mat-24-1","title":"Matthew 24:1","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"MAT","chapterStart":24,"verseStart":1,"chapterEnd":24,"verseEnd":1},"content":"<p>1 Christ foretells the destruction of the temple; 3 what and how great calamities shall be before it; 29 the signs of his coming to judgment. 36 And because that day and hour are unknown, 42 we ought to watch like good servants, expecting every moment our Master's coming.</p>\n<p>departed. 23:39; Jer 6:8; Eze 8:6; 10:17-19; 11:22,23; Ho 9:12 shew. Mr 13:1,2; Lu 21:5,6; Joh 2:20</p>"},{"id":"tsk-mat-24-2","title":"Matthew 24:2","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"MAT","chapterStart":24,"verseStart":2,"chapterEnd":24,"verseEnd":2},"content":"<p>There.Josephus says that \"C�sar gave orders that they should now demolish the whole city and temple, except the three towers Phaselus, Hippicus, and Mariamne, and a part of the western wall; but all the rest was laid so completely even with the ground, by those who dug it up from the foundation, that there was nothing left to make those who came thither believe that it had ever been inhabited.\"</p>\n<p>1Ki 9:7,8; Jer 26:18; Eze 7:20-22; Da 9:26,27; Mic 3:12; Lu 19:44 2Pe 3:11</p>"},{"id":"tsk-mat-24-3","title":"Matthew 24:3","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"MAT","chapterStart":24,"verseStart":3,"chapterEnd":24,"verseEnd":3},"content":"<p>he sat. 21:1; Mr 13:3,4 the disciples. 13:10,11,36; 15:12; 17:19 Tell. Da 12:6-8; Lu 21:7; Joh 21:21,22; Ac 1:7; 1Th 5:1-11 the sign. 32,33,43 the end. 13:39,40,49; 28:20; Heb 9:26</p>"},{"id":"tsk-mat-24-4","title":"Matthew 24:4","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"MAT","chapterStart":24,"verseStart":4,"chapterEnd":24,"verseEnd":4},"content":"<p>Take. Jer 29:8; Mr 13:5,6,22; Lu 21:8; 2Co 11:13-15; Eph 4:14; 5:6 Col 2:8,18 2Th 2:3; 2Pe 2:1-3; 1Jo 4:1</p>"},{"id":"tsk-mat-24-5","title":"Matthew 24:5","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"MAT","chapterStart":24,"verseStart":5,"chapterEnd":24,"verseEnd":5},"content":"<p>in. 11,24; Jer 14:14; 23:21,25; Joh 5:43; Ac 5:36,37; 8:9,10; Re 13:8</p>"},{"id":"tsk-mat-24-6","title":"Matthew 24:6","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"MAT","chapterStart":24,"verseStart":6,"chapterEnd":24,"verseEnd":6},"content":"<p>ye shall hear. Jer 4:19-22; 6:22-24; 8:15,16; 47:6; Eze 7:24-26; 14:17-21 Eze 21:9-15,28; Da 11:1-45; Mr 13:7,8; Lu 21:9 see. Ps 27:1-3; 46:1-3; 112:7; Isa 8:12-14; 12:2; 26:3,4,20,21 Hab 3:16-18; Lu 21:19; Joh 14:1,27; 2Th 2:2; 1Pe 3:14,15 must. 26:54; Lu 22:37; Ac 27:24-26 but. 14; Da 9:24-27</p>"},{"id":"tsk-mat-24-7","title":"Matthew 24:7","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"MAT","chapterStart":24,"verseStart":7,"chapterEnd":24,"verseEnd":7},"content":"<p>nation shall. 2Ch 15:6; Isa 9:19-21; 19:2; Eze 21:27; Hag 2:21,22; Zec 14:2,3,13 Heb 12:27 famines. Isa 24:19-23; Eze 14:21; Joe 2:30,31; Zec 14:4; Lu 21:11,25,26 Ac 2:19; 11:28</p>"},{"id":"tsk-mat-24-8","title":"Matthew 24:8","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"MAT","chapterStart":24,"verseStart":8,"chapterEnd":24,"verseEnd":8},"content":"<p>Le 26:18-29; De 28:59; Isa 9:12,17,21; 10:4; 1Th 5:3; 1Pe 4:17,18</p>"},{"id":"tsk-mat-24-9","title":"Matthew 24:9","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"MAT","chapterStart":24,"verseStart":9,"chapterEnd":24,"verseEnd":9},"content":"<p>shall they. 10:17-22; 22:6; 23:34; Mr 13:9-13; Lu 11:49; 21:12,16,17; Joh 15:19 Joh 15:20; 16:2; Ac 4:2,3; 5:40,41; 7:59; 12:1,2-5; 21:31,32 Ac 22:19-22; 28:22; 1Th 2:14-16; 1Pe 4:16; Re 2:10,13; 6:9-11; 7:14</p>"},{"id":"tsk-mat-24-10","title":"Matthew 24:10","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"MAT","chapterStart":24,"verseStart":10,"chapterEnd":24,"verseEnd":10},"content":"<p>shall many. 11:6; 13:21,57; 26:31-34; Mr 4:17; Joh 6:60,61,66,67; 2Ti 1:15 2Ti 4:10,16 betray. 10:21,35,36; 26:21-24; Mic 7:5,6; Mr 13:12; Lu 21:16</p>"},{"id":"tsk-mat-24-11","title":"Matthew 24:11","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"MAT","chapterStart":24,"verseStart":11,"chapterEnd":24,"verseEnd":11},"content":"<p>5,24; 7:15; Mr 13:22; Ac 20:30; 1Ti 4:1; 2Pe 2:1; 1Jo 2:18,26; 4:1 Jude 1:4; Re 19:20</p>"},{"id":"tsk-mat-24-12","title":"Matthew 24:12","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"MAT","chapterStart":24,"verseStart":12,"chapterEnd":24,"verseEnd":12},"content":"<p>because. Jas 4:1-4; 5:1-6 the love. Re 2:4,5,10; 3:15</p>"},{"id":"tsk-mat-24-13","title":"Matthew 24:13","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"MAT","chapterStart":24,"verseStart":13,"chapterEnd":24,"verseEnd":13},"content":"<p>6; 10:22; Mr 13:13; Lu 8:15; Ro 2:7; 1Co 1:8; Heb 3:6,14; 10:39 Re 2:10</p>"},{"id":"tsk-mat-24-14","title":"Matthew 24:14","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"MAT","chapterStart":24,"verseStart":14,"chapterEnd":24,"verseEnd":14},"content":"<p>this. 4:23; 9:35; 10:7; Ac 20:25 shall be. 18:19; Mr 16:15,16; Lu 24:47; Ac 1:2; Ro 10:18; 15:18-21; 16:25,26 Col 1:6,23; Re 14:6 and then. 3,6; Eze 7:5-7,10</p>"},{"id":"tsk-mat-24-15","title":"Matthew 24:15","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"MAT","chapterStart":24,"verseStart":15,"chapterEnd":24,"verseEnd":15},"content":"<p>ye. Mr 13:14; Lu 19:43; 21:20 by. Da 9:27; 12:11 whoso. Eze 40:4; Da 9:23,25; 10:12-14; Heb 2:1; Re 1:3; 3:22</p>"},{"id":"tsk-mat-24-16","title":"Matthew 24:16","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"MAT","chapterStart":24,"verseStart":16,"chapterEnd":24,"verseEnd":16},"content":"<p>Ge 19:15-17; Ex 9:20,21; Pr 22:3; Jer 6:1; 37:11,12; Lu 21:21,22 Heb 11:7</p>"},{"id":"tsk-mat-24-17","title":"Matthew 24:17","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"MAT","chapterStart":24,"verseStart":17,"chapterEnd":24,"verseEnd":17},"content":"<p>which. 6:25; Job 2:4; Pr 6:4,5; Mr 13:15,16; Lu 17:31-33 the house-top. 10:27; De 22:8</p>"},{"id":"tsk-mat-24-19","title":"Matthew 24:19","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"MAT","chapterStart":24,"verseStart":19,"chapterEnd":24,"verseEnd":19},"content":"<p>De 28:53-56; 2Sa 4:4; 2Ki 15:16; La 4:3,4,10; Ho 13:16; Mr 13:17,18 Lu 21:23; 23:29,30</p>"},{"id":"tsk-mat-24-20","title":"Matthew 24:20","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"MAT","chapterStart":24,"verseStart":20,"chapterEnd":24,"verseEnd":20},"content":"<p>neither. Ex 16:29; Ac 1:12</p>"},{"id":"tsk-mat-24-21","title":"Matthew 24:21","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"MAT","chapterStart":24,"verseStart":21,"chapterEnd":24,"verseEnd":21},"content":"<p>Ps 69:22-28; Isa 65:12-16; 66:15,16; Da 9:26; 12:1; Joe 1:2; 2:2 Zec 11:8,9; 14:2,3; Mal 4:1; Mr 13:9; Lu 19:43,44; 21:24; 1Th 2:16 Heb 10:26-29</p>"},{"id":"tsk-mat-24-22","title":"Matthew 24:22","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"MAT","chapterStart":24,"verseStart":22,"chapterEnd":24,"verseEnd":22},"content":"<p>except. Mr 13:20 for. Isa 6:13; 65:8,9; Zec 13:8; 14:2; Ro 9:11; 11:25-31; 2Ti 2:10</p>"},{"id":"tsk-mat-24-23","title":"Matthew 24:23","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"MAT","chapterStart":24,"verseStart":23,"chapterEnd":24,"verseEnd":23},"content":"<p>De 13:1-3; Mr 13:21; Lu 17:23,24; 21:8; Joh 5:43</p>"},{"id":"tsk-mat-24-24","title":"Matthew 24:24","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"MAT","chapterStart":24,"verseStart":24,"chapterEnd":24,"verseEnd":24},"content":"<p>there. 5,11; 2Pe 2:1-3; 3:17 and shall. De 13:1; 2Th 2:9-11; Re 13:13,14; 19:20 insomuch. Joh 6:37,39; 10:28-30; Ro 8:28-39; 2Ti 2:19; 1Pe 1:5; 1Jo 5:18 Re 12:9-11; 13:7,8,14 if. Mr 13:22; Ac 20:16; Ro 12:18; Ga 4:15</p>"},{"id":"tsk-mat-24-25","title":"Matthew 24:25","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"MAT","chapterStart":24,"verseStart":25,"chapterEnd":24,"verseEnd":25},"content":"<p>Isa 44:7,8; 46:10,11; 48:5,6; Lu 21:13; Joh 16:1</p>"},{"id":"tsk-mat-24-26","title":"Matthew 24:26","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"MAT","chapterStart":24,"verseStart":26,"chapterEnd":24,"verseEnd":26},"content":"<p>Wherefore.Our Lord not only foretells the appearance of these impostors, but also the manner and circumstance of their conduct. Accordingly, Josephus says that many impostors persuaded the people to follow them to the desert, promising them signs and wonders done by the providence of God. (See also Ac 21:38). One persuaded the people to go up into the temple, which being set on fire by the Romans, 6,000 perished in the flames.</p>\n<p>he is in the desert. 3:1; Isa 40:3; Lu 3:2,3; Ac 21:38</p>"},{"id":"tsk-mat-24-27","title":"Matthew 24:27","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"MAT","chapterStart":24,"verseStart":27,"chapterEnd":24,"verseEnd":27},"content":"<p>as. Job 37:3; 38:35; Isa 30:30; Zec 9:14; Lu 17:24-37 the coming. 16:28; Mal 3:2; 4:5; Jas 5:8; 2Pe 3:4</p>"},{"id":"tsk-mat-24-28","title":"Matthew 24:28","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"MAT","chapterStart":24,"verseStart":28,"chapterEnd":24,"verseEnd":28},"content":"<p>De 28:49; Job 39:27-30; Jer 16:16; Am 9:1-4; Lu 17:37</p>"},{"id":"tsk-mat-24-29","title":"Matthew 24:29","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"MAT","chapterStart":24,"verseStart":29,"chapterEnd":24,"verseEnd":29},"content":"<p>Immediately. 8; Da 7:11,12; Mr 13:24,25 shall the. Isa 13:10; 24:23; Jer 4:23-28; Eze 32:7,8; Joe 2:10,30,31; 3:15 Am 5:20; 8:9; Zep 1:14,15; Lu 21:25,26; Ac 2:19,20; Re 6:12-17 the powers. 2Pe 3:10</p>"},{"id":"tsk-mat-24-30","title":"Matthew 24:30","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"MAT","chapterStart":24,"verseStart":30,"chapterEnd":24,"verseEnd":30},"content":"<p>the sign. 3; Da 7:13; Mr 13:4; Re 1:7 and then shall all. Zec 12:10; Re 1:7 see. 16:27,28; 26:64; Mr 13:26; 14:62-64; Lu 21:27; 22:69; Ac 1:11 2Th 1:7</p>"},{"id":"tsk-mat-24-31","title":"Matthew 24:31","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"MAT","chapterStart":24,"verseStart":31,"chapterEnd":24,"verseEnd":31},"content":"<p>he. 28:18; Mr 16:15,16; Lu 24:47; Ac 26:19,20 his angels. 13:41; 25:31; Re 1:20; 2:1; 14:6-9 with. Nu 10:1-10; Ps 81:3; Isa 27:13; 1Co 15:52; 1Th 4:16 a great sound of a trumpet. or, a trumpet and a great voice. gather. Isa 11:12; 49:18; 60:4; Zec 14:5; Mr 13:27; Joh 11:52; Eph 1:10 2Th 2:1 from. Ps 22:27; 67:7; Isa 13:5; 42:10; 43:6; 45:22; Zec 9:10; Ro 10:18</p>"},{"id":"tsk-mat-24-32","title":"Matthew 24:32","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"MAT","chapterStart":24,"verseStart":32,"chapterEnd":24,"verseEnd":32},"content":"<p>Mr 13:28,29; Lu 21:29,30</p>"},{"id":"tsk-mat-24-33","title":"Matthew 24:33","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"MAT","chapterStart":24,"verseStart":33,"chapterEnd":24,"verseEnd":33},"content":"<p>when. 3 know. Eze 7:2-14; Heb 10:37; Jas 5:9; 1Pe 4:7 it. or, he.</p>"},{"id":"tsk-mat-24-34","title":"Matthew 24:34","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"MAT","chapterStart":24,"verseStart":34,"chapterEnd":24,"verseEnd":34},"content":"<p>This. 12:45; 16:28; 23:36; Mr 13:30,31; Lu 11:50; 21:32,33</p>"},{"id":"tsk-mat-24-35","title":"Matthew 24:35","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"MAT","chapterStart":24,"verseStart":35,"chapterEnd":24,"verseEnd":35},"content":"<p>Heaven. 5:18; Ps 102:26; Isa 34:4; 51:6; 54:10; Jer 31:35,36; Heb 1:11,12 2Pe 3:7-12; Re 6:14; 20:11 my. Nu 23:19; Ps 19:7; 89:34; Pr 30:5; Isa 40:8; 55:11; Tit 1:2; 1Pe 1:25 Re 3:14</p>"},{"id":"tsk-mat-24-36","title":"Matthew 24:36","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"MAT","chapterStart":24,"verseStart":36,"chapterEnd":24,"verseEnd":36},"content":"<p>42,44; 25:13; Zec 14:7; Mr 13:32; Ac 1:7; 1Th 5:2; 2Pe 3:10; Re 3:3 Re 16:15</p>"},{"id":"tsk-mat-24-37","title":"Matthew 24:37","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"MAT","chapterStart":24,"verseStart":37,"chapterEnd":24,"verseEnd":37},"content":"<p>Ge 6:1-7:24; Job 22:15-17; Lu 17:26,27; Heb 11:7; 1Pe 3:20,21 2Pe 2:5; 3:6</p>"},{"id":"tsk-mat-24-38","title":"Matthew 24:38","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"MAT","chapterStart":24,"verseStart":38,"chapterEnd":24,"verseEnd":38},"content":"<p>they. Ge 6:2; 1Sa 25:36-38; 30:16,17; Isa 22:12-14; Eze 16:49,50 Am 6:3-6; Lu 12:19,45; 14:18-20; 17:26-28; 21:34; Ro 13:13,14 1Co 7:29-31</p>"},{"id":"tsk-mat-24-39","title":"Matthew 24:39","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"MAT","chapterStart":24,"verseStart":39,"chapterEnd":24,"verseEnd":39},"content":"<p>13:13-15; Jud 20:34; Pr 23:35; 24:12; 29:7; Isa 42:25; 44:18,19 Lu 19:44; Joh 3:20; Ac 13:41; Ro 1:28; 2Pe 3:5</p>"},{"id":"tsk-mat-24-40","title":"Matthew 24:40","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"MAT","chapterStart":24,"verseStart":40,"chapterEnd":24,"verseEnd":40},"content":"<p>the one. 2Ch 33:12-24; Lu 17:34-37; 23:39-43; 1Co 4:7; 2Pe 2:5,7-9</p>"},{"id":"tsk-mat-24-41","title":"Matthew 24:41","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"MAT","chapterStart":24,"verseStart":41,"chapterEnd":24,"verseEnd":41},"content":"<p>Two.The [mulon ] was a hand-mill composed of two stones; \"the uppermost of which is turned round by a small handle of wood or iron that is placed in the rim. When this stone is large, or expedition required, a second person is called to assist; and as it is usual for women alone to be concerned in this employment, who seat themselves over against each other with the millstone between then, we may see not only the propriety of the expression, Ex 11:5,\" but the force of this.--Dr. Shaw.</p>\n<p>grinding. Ex 11:5; Isa 47:2</p>"},{"id":"tsk-mat-24-42","title":"Matthew 24:42","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"MAT","chapterStart":24,"verseStart":42,"chapterEnd":24,"verseEnd":42},"content":"<p>Watch. 25:13; 26:38-41; Mr 13:33-37; Lu 12:35-40; 21:36; Ro 13:11 1Co 16:13; 1Th 5:6; 1Pe 4:7; 5:8; Re 3:2,3; 16:15 for. 36,44; Mr 13:33</p>"},{"id":"tsk-mat-24-43","title":"Matthew 24:43","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"MAT","chapterStart":24,"verseStart":43,"chapterEnd":24,"verseEnd":43},"content":"<p>good-man. 20:11; Pr 7:19 had. Lu 12:39; 1Th 5:2-6; 2Pe 3:10,11 would not. Ex 22:2,3</p>"},{"id":"tsk-mat-24-44","title":"Matthew 24:44","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"MAT","chapterStart":24,"verseStart":44,"chapterEnd":24,"verseEnd":44},"content":"<p>25:10,13; Lu 12:40; Php 4:5; Jas 5:9; Re 19:7</p>"},{"id":"tsk-mat-24-45","title":"Matthew 24:45","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"MAT","chapterStart":24,"verseStart":45,"chapterEnd":24,"verseEnd":45},"content":"<p>is. Lu 12:41-43; 16:10-12; 19:17; Ac 20:28; 1Co 4:1,2; 1Ti 1:12; 2Ti 2:2 Heb 3:5; 1Pe 4:10,11; Re 2:13 to give. 13:52; 25:35-40; Eze 34:2; Joh 21:15-17; 1Co 3:1,2; Eph 4:11-13 1Pe 5:1-3</p>"},{"id":"tsk-mat-24-46","title":"Matthew 24:46","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"MAT","chapterStart":24,"verseStart":46,"chapterEnd":24,"verseEnd":46},"content":"<p>25:34; Lu 12:37,43; Php 1:21-23; 2Ti 4:6-8; 2Pe 1:13-15; Re 2:19 Re 16:15</p>"},{"id":"tsk-mat-24-47","title":"Matthew 24:47","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"MAT","chapterStart":24,"verseStart":47,"chapterEnd":24,"verseEnd":47},"content":"<p>That. 25:21,23; Da 12:3; Lu 12:37,44; 19:17; 22:29,30; Joh 12:26; 2Ti 2:12 1Pe 5:4; Re 3:21; 21:7</p>"},{"id":"tsk-mat-24-48","title":"Matthew 24:48","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"MAT","chapterStart":24,"verseStart":48,"chapterEnd":24,"verseEnd":48},"content":"<p>if. 18:32; 25:26; Lu 19:22 say. De 9:4; 15:9; 2Ki 5:26; Isa 32:6; Mr 7:21; Lu 12:45; Joh 13:2; Ac 5:3 Ac 8:22 My. Ec 8:11; Eze 12:22,27; 2Pe 3:3-5</p>"},{"id":"tsk-mat-24-49","title":"Matthew 24:49","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"MAT","chapterStart":24,"verseStart":49,"chapterEnd":24,"verseEnd":49},"content":"<p>to smite. Isa 66:5; 2Co 11:20; 1Pe 5:3; 3Jo 1:9,10; Re 13:7; 16:6; 17:6 and to. 7:15; 1Sa 2:13-16,29; Isa 56:12; Eze 34:3; Mic 3:5; Ro 16:18 Php 3:19; Tit 1:11,12; 2Pe 2:13,14; Jude 1:12</p>"},{"id":"tsk-mat-24-50","title":"Matthew 24:50","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"MAT","chapterStart":24,"verseStart":50,"chapterEnd":24,"verseEnd":50},"content":"<p>come. 42-44; Pr 29:1; 1Th 5:2,3; Re 3:3</p>"},{"id":"tsk-mat-24-51","title":"Matthew 24:51","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"MAT","chapterStart":24,"verseStart":51,"chapterEnd":24,"verseEnd":51},"content":"<p>cut him asunder. or, cut him off. and appoint. Job 20:29; Isa 33:14; Lu 12:46 there. 8:12; 22:13; 25:30; Lu 13:28</p>"}]}